      "role": "user",
      "content": "it feels like i'm just a ghost lately. like, the person everyone used to follow and listen to... that version of me is just gone. i walk around and people look right through me. it's like i died months ago and i'm just stuck in this shell of a life that doesnt even belong to me anymore.",
