    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "how do you mean \"make yourself invisible\"? it feels like i'm already doing that. i'm just tired of the acting. it's exhausting to keep up this charade of being a person when i don't even feel real anymore. it's like there's nothing left to actually hold onto.",
